age snapshots. The missing responsibility is how snapshot-covered application work must be reconciled: complete it before snapshot installation, discard covered entries, or otherwise prevent replaying historical configuration operations against restored membership. The acquired documentation does not specify this handoff. No production state-machine implementation or complete legal post-restore application history has been established for this Surface.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"async-contract\",\n        \"async-worker-doc\",\n        \"storage-tail\",\n        \"snapshot-restore\",\n        \"config-activate\",\n        \"interaction-ready-routing\",\n        \"interaction-apply-worker\",\n        \"interaction-append-worker\",\n        \"interaction-snapshot-storage\",\n        \"rawnode-network-rejection\"\n      ],\n      \"high_consequence\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"core_regions\": [\n    {\n      \"activity\": \"A1\",\n      \"entries\": [\n        {\n          \"class_id\": \"A1\",\n          \"applicability\": \"applicable\",\n          \"purpose\": \"Qualified support for decision formation and legal advancement\",\n          \"realization_summary\": \"Replicated prefix and safe-read support are aggregated under active voters.\",\n          \"entry_points\": [],\n          \"behavior_ids\": [\n            \"B-propose\",\n            \"B-follower-append\",\n            \"B-aggregate\",\n            \"B-read\"\n          ],\n          \"variants\": [],\n          \"unknowns\": [],\n          \"source_ids\": [\n            \"append-receive\",\n            \"candidate-follower\",\n            \"config-activate\",\n            \"joint\",\n            \"leader-admit\",\n            \"leader-match\",\n            \"leader-other\",\n            \"log-eligibility\",\n            \"log-start-append\",\n            \"majority\",\n            \"mode-contract\",\n            \"progress-update\",\n            \"read-pending\",\n            \"read-release\",\n